{
  "name": "MetricBucket",
  "type": "object",
  "description": "P0.3 \u2014 S\u00e9rie temporal di\u00e1ria materializada para o Business Dashboard. unique_participants (por evento) e leads (por evento + partner_id). SOFRE decremento no soft-delete de Participant (preserva sem\u00e2ntica is_deleted:false). Leads s\u00e3o append-only. Reconstru\u00edda por reconcileBusinessMetrics. Queries por bucket_date (string YYYY-MM-DD) funcionam (range queries em created_date n\u00e3o).",
  "properties": {
    "event_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID do evento"
    },
    "metric_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "unique_participants",
        "leads"
      ],
      "description": "Tipo de m\u00e9trica di\u00e1ria"
    },
    "bucket_date": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Chave do dia (YYYY-MM-DD) derivada do created_date do registro de origem"
    },
    "partner_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "description": "Para m\u00e9trica 'leads': ID do parceiro. Vazio para unique_participants."
    },
    "value": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Contador do bucket"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "event_id",
    "metric_type",
    "bucket_date"
  ]
}